msgid "Lowrance Elite Ti2 Sonar"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-lowrance-elite-ti2-sonar.rst:7
#: 6ea99445ff3f4ac78f0b59ff946770b9
msgid "The `Lowrance Elite Ti2 sonar <https://www.lowrance.com/lowrance/type/fishfinders-chartplotters/elite-7-ti2-us-inland-ai-3-in-1/>`__ can be connected to the autopilot so that the sonar can use the autopilot's position estimate (which is normally better than the sonar's built-in GPS) and the autopilot can record and report the sonar's simple depth."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-lowrance-elite-ti2-sonar.rst:12
#: 2dc3aa7c702d4ad7bfe0bd1542280a3f
msgid "Discussion of this sonar's setup is `here <https://discuss.ardupilot.org/t/lowrance-nmea-0183-to-cube-orange/86057/8>`__"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-lowrance-elite-ti2-sonar.rst:15
#: b520bf38c512408ab65cc6ddf6ac243c
msgid "Hardware Setup"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-lowrance-elite-ti2-sonar.rst:20
#: 64b9447b44a44c9996567293b47ae402
msgid "Purchase an `RS422 to TTL converter <https://www.amazon.com/LM-bi-directional-Full-duplex-single-chip-microcomputer/dp/B01NGTMROI>`__"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-lowrance-elite-ti2-sonar.rst:21
#: 5138dbeea01940318b706f596379b939
msgid "Connect the sonar's NMEA 0183 pins to the left side of the converter as shown above"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-lowrance-elite-ti2-sonar.rst:22
#: dc09f9d8dd8f4a15a586fb26b60946d2
msgid "Connect one of the autopilot's serial ports to the right side of the converter as shown above"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-lowrance-elite-ti2-sonar.rst:25
#: e8db1a94dd65460a8c29c78fdcb1ec38
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-lowrance-elite-ti2-sonar.rst:27
#: 8e04c249d68442e486a969f284c69266
msgid "If the autopilot's Serial2 port (aka Telem2) is used then the following parameters should be set:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-lowrance-elite-ti2-sonar.rst:29
#: 4da7677eb1b541f4aadb7b570fa185ac
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL <SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = 9 (Lidar)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-lowrance-elite-ti2-sonar.rst:30
#: 51ca13e3c04947d8bfc3c38aaf986527
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL2_BAUD <SERIAL2_BAUD>` = 38 (38400 baud) to match the baud rate the Elite is using"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-lowrance-elite-ti2-sonar.rst:32
#: 18e16ab5eaa84ddea0e65f400f15d177
msgid "These rangefinder parameters should also be set:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-lowrance-elite-ti2-sonar.rst:34
#: 7b5ea5d23a024971b22d58f413a56e91
msgid ":ref:`RNGFND1_TYPE <RNGFND1_TYPE>` = 17 (NMEA)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-lowrance-elite-ti2-sonar.rst:35
#: c57d171b41ef43179b1785d90631fff2
msgid ":ref:`RNGFND1_MIN <RNGFND1_MIN>` = 0.13"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-lowrance-elite-ti2-sonar.rst:36
#: e26fe485139140199675bb97e55f56ae
msgid ":ref:`RNGFND1_MAX <RNGFND1_MAX>` = 300 (300m)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-lowrance-elite-ti2-sonar.rst:37
#: 0c10a5dceede405a82557b2d8f56d3fd
msgid ":ref:`RNGFND1_ORIENT <RNGFND1_ORIENT>` = 25 (down)"
msgstr ""

